{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2022-10-04 11:30:00', 'title': 'COMED ENERGY DOCTORS OFFER ENERGY-SAVING TIPS FOR COLD WEATHER IN TIME FOR NATIONAL ENERGY EFFICIENCY DAY', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS TEMPERATURES DROP, COMED'S ENERGY DOCTORS OFFER ENERGY-SAVING TIPS FOR COLD WEATHER TO HELP FAMILIES AND INDIVIDUALS MANAGE ENERGY USE AND SAVE MONEY ON ELECTRIC BILLS – JUST IN TIME FOR NATIONAL ENERGY EFFICIENCY DAY, WHICH IS WEDNESDAY, OCT. 5. “COMED'S ENERGY DOCTORS ARE EXPERTS COMMITTED TO HELPING CUSTOMERS – ESPECIALLY THOSE FACING ECONOMIC HARDSHIPS – REDUCE THEIR ELECTRICITY USE AND SAVE MONEY,” SAID MELISSA WASHINGTON, COMED'S CHIEF CUSTOMER OFFICER AND SEN"}